---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<Base title={`Terms & Conditions | ${site.company}`} description="Website and SMS terms for New Block accessibility review inquiries.">
  <main class="wrap legal">
    <a href="/">← Back to the accessibility page</a>
    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p>Updated September 28, 2026</p>
    <p>This page is operated by {site.company}. Submitting an inquiry asks us to contact you about an on-site or website accessibility review. It does not itself book or purchase a service. We will confirm the scope, availability, price, and any service agreement separately.</p>

    <h2>Information on this site</h2>
    <p>Website content is general information and is not legal advice. An inspection can identify and document accessibility issues, but no inspection can guarantee that a business will avoid a claim or lawsuit.</p>

    <h2>Optional text messages</h2>
    <p>Our text messaging program is intended for people who are 18 years of age or older. By opting in, you confirm that you are at least 18.</p>
    <p>If you check the optional SMS consent box, {site.company} may text you from +1 (949) 569-6374 about your accessibility review inquiry and scheduling. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Consent to texts is not a condition of purchase.</p>
    <p>Reply STOP to a message to cancel texts. We may send one confirmation of your opt-out. Reply HELP for assistance, or contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={`tel:${site.phoneE164}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>. To join again, submit a new form and choose text consent. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2>Privacy and contact</h2>
    <p>Read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how we handle information. You can contact {site.company} at {site.address}, <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or <a href={`tel:${site.phoneE164}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal{max-width:760px;padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:80px}
  .legal h1{margin:24px 0 10px}
  .legal h2{font-size:1.4rem;margin:34px 0 8px}
  .legal p{color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px}
  .legal a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline}
</style>
